cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use methylTFRAnnotationHg38, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "methylTFRAnnotationHg38: methylTFR annotations for hg38"
abstract: >-
  Precomputed transcription factor binding sites, motif GC frequency tables
  and a genome-wide GC distribution for the human (hg38) genome, for use with the
  methylTFR package. The data are hosted on AnnotationHub and retrieved on
  first use.
